Description:
    Generate the GraphQL type for every model-backed controlled vocabulary's
    records, and the ControlledVocabularyKind enum. Run it after migrating,
    since it reads each model's columns.

Example:
    bin/rails generate controlled_vocabulary_graphql

    This will create (or overwrite):
        app/graphql/types/controlled_vocabulary_kind_type.rb
        app/graphql/types/<model>_type.rb (one per vocabulary)
